{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202645iTBVJuNl1795672982.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報美國晶片巨頭輝達停止向東南亞國家出貨。</p><p></p><p>英國《金融時報》引述三名知情人士表示，輝達已告知合作夥伴，停止向東南亞出貨伺服器。其合作夥伴戴爾和超微電腦告知馬來西亞、新加坡、泰國和印尼的買家，輝達將不允許其訂單出貨。目前仍未清楚措施是否屬暫時性。輝達與合作夥伴正努力遵守美國新的出口限制。</p><p></p><p>輝達就報道拒絕置評。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.809816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:14.642775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:44.170255+00:00","content_hash":"6ca52f27de8d28fcf4f64ea20b7f42271f2d934c84ae542f5b0ed44565542236","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.809816+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}